    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d779-a5">

                <pb facs="0634" n="518" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg518"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 5—Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">General Carranza to the
                            Mediators.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Chihuahua</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-05-03">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">May 3, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>I have the honor to refer to your message of yesterday. Having accepted in
                    principle the good offices of the nations which you so worthily represent, I
                    take the liberty now to ask you to be kind enough to make definite the points
                    which are to be covered by said good offices in the pending conflict between the
                    United States and Mexico, so that I may appoint a representative with due
                    authorization.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">V. Carranza</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
